# S13-segments: S13-game in the `segments` x-ray: each span's affine runs in rust and
# brown, a lava tick at each of id's perspective divides, every 16 pixels. The film's S13
# was rendered by the first version of the film tool, whose `segments` x-ray placed some
# of the ticks elsewhere; the x-ray has changed since, so a render today differs from the
# film's S13 once the sweep has begun (its file's frames 101 to 263), and the film keeps
# that file as it was made. S13-game, the picture under it, still matches.
#
# Under V3-07: "And one division, rationed."
#
# Assembly (S13): S13-segments over S13-game, revealed from the left edge by a vertical
# cut that crosses the frame between file seconds 1.9 and 2.5 (smoothstep) and stays.

map e1m5

duration 4.4
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset classic
mode 320x200
hud off

camera fixed -1536,1432,200 0,90

xray segments
